[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4862.55, "timestamp": "01:21:02", "text": "我想象的那样，我有点害怕。 我当时想："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4864.55, "timestamp": "01:21:04", "text": "“那是个人吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4869.03, "timestamp": "01:21:09", "text": "然后我就想，“哦，等等，那是你。”   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4871.51, "timestamp": "01:21:11", "text": "。 某个时候。 某个时候。 所以，你还是希望自己能随时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4877.27, "timestamp": "01:21:17", "text": "知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.79, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "队友在哪里。 所以，你想体验一下被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4880.55, "timestamp": "01:21:20", "text": "吓一跳的感觉。 我没有遇到过这种情况，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4885.669, "timestamp": "01:21:25", "text": "但我知道有些人会遇到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4888.229, "timestamp": "01:21:28", "text": "这里只有任务本身。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4899.59, "timestamp": "01:21:39", "text": "那是我第一次玩的时候的样子，老兄。   是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4903.83, "timestamp": "01:21:43", "text": "啊，但是也没有小地图。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4911.669, "timestamp": "01:21:51", "text": "解密建筑物中的模块。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4914.07, "timestamp": "01:21:54", "text": "异常现象的西侧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4917.75, "timestamp": "01:21:57", "text": "西侧应该就在这里附近。 好的。"}]